    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9adb2c79cf8c7e020b0a1f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，是新来的研讨会参加者吗？\n那会觉得不可思议也不奇怪。\n其实――我啊，曾经是竞技赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfa146aa1852bd2c4d6436bfe4a7c4e49cb1f6760ce5dc204a6d26c842780ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
