    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cef73388871eac349078360",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你看，本店拉面里有鱼板――\n也就是培养短距离所需快肌的食材，\n放了很多吧？那也是学习的一环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b833992e61a6cc1e8b6e8e75388539e969fa1e505cf94f323ed1f535b30c8470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
