      "uid": "zhcn:726b2158c9769d9803afec96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蛋白质、矿物质，\n脂质和碳水化合物……吃了拉面，\n一切都会调整好――一切都会顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d589df81f552420ccc678ecbc6fed0addb55a387ec740141c782d1078feb54c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
