      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么――啊！有『直线硬面堂』！\n走吧训练员，马上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67fd6f1aec051106f6935c92e9db720ba169ee6ffce94aace3b47e2c21bf530c",
