      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，金镇之光以积极的样子听了下去――\n我觉得，也许来这一趟是对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad4dfa6fff8e05e3c3e9b31b8796a1d84dfaebb16b176328fab5044fd27d481",
