      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前，那里递给我们晾衣夹，\n还让我们钓明太鳕――『直线硬面堂』。\n……老实说，很可怕。我警惕着走进店里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed32e743b4f5f28f9e961814e1d9f45d11378a22811a5b5e78d1c4c35bf046da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
