      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "钻研硬面，等同于钻研短距离――至少，\n金镇之光似乎是这么认为的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aed0a3047c623d2ed3ec32dea58244d9edc1dc3ddb83ed00a74cab8d1bafc68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
